					},
					"elements": [
						{
							"id": "715b7fc",
							"elType": "widget",
							"widgetType": "heading",
							"settings": {
								"title": "Ken's note",
								"header_size": "p",
								"_css_classes": "eyebrow"
							},
							"elements": []
						},
						{
							"id": "59472fc",
							"elType": "widget",
							"widgetType": "text-editor",
							"settings": {
								"editor": "<p>The honeymoons that go wrong are the over-planned ones. Couples arrive exhausted from a wedding and are handed a schedule that starts at seven.</p>\n<p>So we design the first two days almost empty. Sleep, eat well, walk somewhere beautiful without a plan. The journey proper starts on day three, and by then you actually want it.</p>",
								"_css_classes": "bt-landing-insight__body"
							},
							"elements": []
						},
						{
							"id": "2be48ae",
							"elType": "widget",
							"widgetType": "text-editor",
							"settings": {
								"editor": "<p>Ken FJ Her — founder, Brother Tours. Licensed Lao National Tour Guide since 2010; founded Brother Tours in 2018.</p>",
								"_css_classes": "bt-landing-insight__attribution"
							},
							"elements": []
						}
					],
